            <title><![CDATA[[service-workers-1] FetchEvent.replacesClientId removed from all browsers for 2+ years]]></title>
            <link>https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42195</link>
            <guid>https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42195</guid>
            <pubDate>Tue, 02 Dec 2025 09:18:10 GMT</pubDate>
            <content:encoded><![CDATA[<h3 dir="auto">MDN URL</h3>
<p dir="auto"><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/FetchEvent/replacesClientId" rel="nofollow">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/FetchEvent/replacesClientId</a></p>
<h3 dir="auto">What specific section or headline is this issue about?</h3>
<p dir="auto"><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/FetchEvent/replacesClientId#browser_compatibility" rel="nofollow">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/FetchEvent/replacesClientId#browser_compatibility</a></p>
<h3 dir="auto">What information was incorrect, unhelpful, or incomplete?</h3>
<p dir="auto">The <code class="notranslate">FetchEvent.replacesClientId</code> page documents a feature that was removed from all browsers more than 2 years ago.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">What did you expect to see?</h3>
<p dir="auto">The page should no longer exist.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Do you have any supporting links, references, or citations?</h3>
<p dir="auto">The BCD data was removed in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2527291283" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/24443" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/24443/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/24443">mdn/browser-compat-data#24443</a>.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Do you have anything more you want to share?</h3>
<p dir="auto">Reported by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/c-antin/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/c-antin">@c-antin</a> in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3680067537" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28556" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28556/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28556">mdn/browser-compat-data#28556</a>.</p>
