        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[[service-workers-1] Very misleading example for window focus from notification / service worker]]></title>
            <link>https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41483</link>
            <guid>https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41483</guid>
            <pubDate>Sun, 12 Oct 2025 20:28:49 GMT</pubDate>
            <content:encoded><![CDATA[<h3 dir="auto">MDN URL</h3>
<p dir="auto"><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Clients/openWindow" rel="nofollow">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Clients/openWindow</a></p>
<h3 dir="auto">What specific section or headline is this issue about?</h3>
<p dir="auto">Examples</p>
<h3 dir="auto">What information was incorrect, unhelpful, or incomplete?</h3>
<p dir="auto">This example as it stands does not work as one would expect. There is a check being made to see if <code class="notranslate">client.url</code> matches the notification URL. But the <code class="notranslate">client.url</code> will not change after subsequent navigation, thus even if the notification URL matches the actual "current URL", this check will not pass - and hence the current window will not be focused - thus defeating the purpose of this example.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">What did you expect to see?</h3>
<p dir="auto">Dunno. Since this piece of code does not work as expected, and in fact is downright misleading, it should be removed.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Do you have any supporting links, references, or citations?</h3>
<p dir="auto"><a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="626821473" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/w3c/ServiceWorker/issues/1515" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/w3c/ServiceWorker/issues/1515/hovercard?comment_id=3389562474&amp;comment_type=issue_comment" href="https://github.com/w3c/ServiceWorker/issues/1515#issuecomment-3389562474">w3c/ServiceWorker#1515 (comment)</a></p>
<h3 dir="auto">Do you have anything more you want to share?</h3>
<p dir="auto"><em>No response</em></p>
